      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-05-24_WidnesExaminer_art0012" n="art0012">
        <head>"HAVE YOU SUSPECTED YOUR KIDNEYS ?"</head>
        <p>"HAVE YOU SUSPECTED YOUR KIDNEYS ?"</p>
        <p>A of</p>
        <p>"Kidney Disease makes an Aching Back, a Weak Heart makes you Rheumatic, Nervous, Irritable, Dropsical. It comes on quietly, but is Fatal if Neglected."</p>
        <p>"Have you ever thought what it is that makes your back ache, your head, limbs, or muscles ache. that weakens your heart, or makes you nervous, sleepless, or irritable?</p>
        <p>the pains would dart across my back like knife- stabs.</p>
        <p>"I had nasty headaches, which made me feel 'miserable. There was distress in relieving the 'bladder; the water was painful and full of a dark, 'heavy sediment. "I tried many medicines, bu t never seemed to be able to get any permanent benefit until I used Doan's Backache Kidney Pills. Three boxes of these pills drove away every symptom of kidney complaint from my system, and also improved my general health. That is now about six months ago, and I have not felt the slightest sign of a return. Doan's pills are a splendid kidney medicine, and I have told many people about them. (Signed) J. MILNER."</p>
        <p>" It is kidney trouble, and the above are some of the warnings. " Doan's Backache Kidney Pills should be taken at the first sign of anything wrong. They are the reliable Kidney and Bladder medicine, and are rl perfectly safe for men and women to use." The best evidence of this is the ringing statement 1 given here.</p>
        <p>Neighbour's Statement about the Value Doan's Backache Kidney Pills in Kidney, Dropsical and Uric Acid Disorders.</p>
        <p>219 a box, six boxes 1319, of all dealers, or from Foster- McClellan C 0,3, Wells-st. Oifford-st., London. w. Don.'t ask for Backache or Kidney Pills—ask for Doan's Back- ache Kidney Pills.</p>
