      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-05-24_WidnesExaminer_art0195" n="art0195">
        <head>MISS EMMA LEE.</head>
        <p>MISS EMMA LEE.</p>
        <p>As an illustration we give here the record of a young echool teacher who became paralysed after a long period of nervous strain. Happily she has recovered with the aid of Dr. Williams' Pink Pills.</p>
        <p>Miss Emma Lee, of Cross Row, 562 Stonebroom, near Alfreton, a young lady who occupies the position of teacher at the Shitland Schools, states: "Some time ago I developed nervous weakness. The doctor said that it was due to my anaemic state. I was highly strung and over studious. " Then my arm began to have queer tnitchings, ar.d I was afraid to take a cup into my hand, for my fingers often lost their grip. Later on the twitchings extended to my leg, and my left side became paralysed. Then I could not get about at all. When mother lifted my arm up it just fell again and hung uselessly by my side. " One dcctor said that it was a serious case of Partial Paralysis. For two years I was a wreck, and no one expected me to be well again. "Then mother gave me a course of Dr. Williams' Pink Pills. As I continued taking these Pills a feeling of new life crept into my side. Then all numb- ness passed away, and as I t.iok box after box of Dr. Williams' Pink Pills my cure was perfected. Now, no trace of nervous ieakness or of Paralysis remains, and I have never since had the least sign of the terrible symptoms." Mrs. Lee, who was present, added: "I can never feel sufficiently grateful to Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for restoring my daughter to health." Sufferers from any nerveus ailments should write for Free Book," Diseases of the Nervous System," post free. Strengthen your Nerves by building up the Blood— that is the great secret of the many successes achieved by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People in cases of St. Vitus' Dance, Neurasthenia, Partial Paralysis and Nervous Disorders. Obtainable of all dealers, or direct from Dr. Williams' Medicine Co., .16 Holborn Viaduct, London, E.C., pr ice 28. 93. per box, or six boxes for 13s. 9d. post free, But no sly substitute will do ; you must insist on having Dr. Williams' Pink Pills.</p>
