      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-05-24_WidnesExaminer_art0224" n="art0224">
        <head>Examiner, Saturday, May 24, 1913.</head>
        <p>The Examiner, Saturday, May 24, 1913.</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON WORKS ASSOCIATION.</p>
        <p>-^</p>
        <p>FINLAYSON CUP COMPETITION. FIRST ROUND.</p>
        <p>The first round of tbis highly popular competition was continued on Saturday on the Horse and Jockey preen, which was in splendid condition. Details of the day's play are appended : Thewlis, Griffiths and Edelsten's. Longford No. 2. G Ball, 1 ... 15 R Ratcliffe, 5 ... ... 5 .1 15 H Fogg, 5 ... ... 14 .1 Dagnall, 5 ... ... 15 W Craven, .. 7 . ... 7 J Taylor, 5 ... 5 P Bladen, 5 ... 15 F Molyneux, 5 ... ... 15 A Appleton, 4 ... 5 A Molyneux, 5.. ... 14 W Hampson, 6... ... 15 W Hadcroft, 4 ... ... T Brookes, jun. 7 ... 15 T Roberts, 5 ... ... 12 G Ganson, 6 ... 15 W Cook, 5._ ... 15 j Fearnley, 6 ... 10 T Rowlands. 4 15 W Sirnister, 6 ... 14 A Lingard, 4 ... 15 P Fearnley, 6 ... .....14 H Hotcroft, 5 ... ... 15 J Salt, 6 ... 13 159 145 Thewlis and Griffiths won by 14. Crosfield's No. 2. _ Union Tanneries.</p>
        <p>H Carter, 4 ... 15 T Lester, 7 .., 10 L Higham, 4 ... 15 H Goulden, 5 ... 8 J Weave, 5 13 J Gregory, 5 ... 15 G Bond, 4......12 P Fillingham, 5 ... 15 A Worrall, ... 15 H Gatley, 5 Willett, 4 ... ... 15 S H Dale, 6 ... 9 J Woods, 4 ... ... 15 W Dickenson, 5 ... 10 J Smith, 6 ... 11 A Parr, 6 ... ... 15 J Woolridge, 4 ... 11 W Bate, 5 ... 15 C Dagnall, 4 ... ... 7 F Lloyd, 7 ... 15 W Stokes, 3 ... 12 T Evans, 6 ... 15 H Dagnall,4 11 3 Barlow, 7 ... 15</p>
        <p>152 149 Crosfield's won by 3. Robinson's Glass Works. Rylands Wet Shop. S Fair, 3 ... ••• ... 14 j Hilton, 4 ... ... 15 T Rudge, 7 ......15 H Newton, 4 ... 11 C Grant, 4 ......10 H Higham, 5 ... ... 15 D Anderson, 4......15 F Phillips, 5 ... 5 It Atkinson, 7 ... ... 12 T Eyres, 6 ... ... 15 R Warburton, ... 15 .3 Birchall, 6 ... ... 8 T Cardoe, 4 ••• ... 8 T Hansbury, 5... ... 15 J Hutchinson, 2... ... 15 J Molyneux, 4... ... 12 W Towers, 6 ... 12 J Hankey, 3 ... ... 15 J Houltram, 6 11 F Cooper, 3 ... ... 15 D Nealing, 7 ... 15 G Barlow, 5 ... 6 W Barlow, 4 H E Scott, 5 ... ... 15</p>
