        <p>The Warrington Equitable Industrial Go-operative Society Limited. A SPECIAL GENERAL MEETING of the Members is hereby called by the Committee of Management under the authority of Rule 30, to be held IN THE CO.OPERATIVE HALL, CAIRO STREET, ON MONDAY NEXT,: MAY 26th, AT 8 p.m. BUSINESS : To receive the report of the Committee regarding the recent dispute with the Employees, and to pass such resolutions thereon as may be deemed advisable. Also by requisition signed by 99 persons : To consider the present position of the Society's Employees in regard to their action in present dispute. For the Committee, T. WADSWORTH, President, J. JARMAN, Secretary. MEMBERS ONLY can be admitted on shewing their Membership Card at the door. It will also be necessary to produce the Dividend Warrant or Pass Book, so that Voting Cards can be issued to those having a L-1 share.</p>
